  "fdLines": [
    {
      "day": 23,
      "line": "The feast's fire burns low — the buff fades with the night. (Feasted expired.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 23,
      "line": "🍖 FEAST 📺 — Luna opens the pantry wide: 14× Cattail, 3× Cattail. Booker, Sam, Quinn, Brian eat until the fire burns low. Somebody tells the story again, the one everybody already knows. For one evening, hunger feels like a rumor. (−2,040 kcal from the pantry) The channeled keepsake feeds the feast — the feast was the weapon, and the surge rides the fire until tomorrow's dawn, spent only when the blades are warmed. (FEAST SURGE ×1.5 armed)"
    },
    {
      "day": 23,
      "line": "🍖 FEASTED ×2.03 until tomorrow's dawn (6 parts left): a proper feast. A channeled keepsake feeds the flames (devotion ×1.5). Strikes and abilities hit with the feast behind them."
    },
    {
      "day": 23,
      "line": "🌙 The cookfire's smell carried further than the laughter did — smoke and grease on the night wind. Night Court is circling the edge of the light. It followed the feast here. (A scavenger, drawn by the feast. Face it while the feast is in you — or let the watch drive it off.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 23,
      "line": "FEASTED ×2.03: the feast was the weapon."
    },
    {
      "day": 23,
      "line": "FEASTED ×2.03: the feast was the weapon."
    },
    {
      "day": 23,
      "line": "💛 You hold Photo Album. Faces from before. Lerato's wedding. Your dad asleep in the chair. The neighbor's kid with the missing tooth. The most valuable thing you own, and it weighs nothing. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "📺 \"But real talk? The next act needs a BIGGER STAGE. I can't stage it with ONE fire — there's not enough of you to REFLECT, you feel me? Get me STANDING — blood, bonds, or bread. Rack up the kills, season your alliances, or feast like legends. Make it worth escalating.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "The feast's fire burns low — the buff fades with the night. (Feasted expired.)"
    },
    {
